Mesa 4.0.4 Xlib/XMesa and client-side GLX binding

Source: https://github.com/NetBSD/xsrc.git
Exact commit: 11b245db07732c501bc8bb4ca073f823a6c65b84
Sources from xfree/xc/extras/Mesa/src/X; headers listed in SOURCE-MAP.
Renderer sources carry preserved MIT/X11 notices. SGI headers retain
their SGI Free Software License B 1.1 notices; complete licenses are
in ../mesa/LICENSE.MIT and ../mesa/LICENSE.SGI-B-1.1.

UPSTREAM-SHA256 records original file content, before local corrections.
Local corrections implement missing GLX 1.3 behavior, context lifetime
and validation; native XGL acceleration hooks are explicitly conditional.

The conditional native build also installs OldenGL's object-space transform,
lighting, clipping and texture stage before the standard Mesa TNL pipeline.
LOCAL-PATCHES.diff records the exact integration changes.
